WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.310
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:13.311 --> 00:00:16.999
I'm a walrus.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.698
Walruses are big sea mammals.

4
00:00:22.699 --> 00:00:25.552
Where do you live?

5
00:00:25.553 --> 00:00:32.341
We live near the Arctic Circle.

6
00:00:32.342 --> 00:00:36.979
It is very cold here!

7
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:40.381
How do you stay warm?

8
00:00:40.382 --> 00:00:44.422
We have lots of blubber.

9
00:00:44.423 --> 00:00:48.446
Blubber is a type of fat.

10
00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:53.747
It keeps us nice and warm.

11
00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:58.476
You have huge tusks!

12
00:00:58.477 --> 00:01:03.791
Our tusks are long teeth.

13
00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:09.123
We use them to poke holes in ice.

14
00:01:09.124 --> 00:01:13.805
Our tusks also protect us from enemies.

15
00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:16.532
Can you swim?

16
00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:21.263
Walruses swim very well.

17
00:01:21.264 --> 00:01:24.982
We're not fast.

18
00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:31.420
But we can swim for a long time.

19
00:01:31.421 --> 00:01:34.085
What do you eat?

20
00:01:34.086 --> 00:01:40.328
Walruses mostly eat clams from the ocean floor.

21
00:01:40.329 --> 00:01:49.999
We use our whiskers to find the clams.

22
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.830
Do you live with other walruses?

23
00:01:53.831 --> 00:01:59.608
Yes, walruses live in big groups.

24
00:01:59.609 --> 00:02:07.375
We like to lie on the beach together.

25
00:02:07.376 --> 00:02:10.902
It's time to sleep now.

26
00:02:10.903 --> 00:02:13.975
Good-bye!

27
00:02:13.976 --> 00:02:25.735
Good-bye, Walrus!

